{{Quote|One of the three Legendary Swords, infused with a ghost.|Item}}
'''Shizu''' (formerly known as '''Shisui''') is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

Shizu provides extremely fast and near instant combos, making it a viable option in PvP. 

Much like [[Soul Cane]] however, it is hard to use due to small hitboxes and [[Instinct]] issues, which is why this sword is not seen much.

==Obtainment==
{{Main|Legendary Sword Dealer}}
Shizu can be bought at the price of {{Money|2,000,000}} from the [[Legendary Sword Dealer]].

The [[Legendary Sword Dealer]] rarely spawns in the [[Second Sea]], every time this [[NPCs|NPC]] spawns, he sells one sword out of the three '''Legendary Swords''' which are [[Saishi]], Shizu and [[Oroshi]].

